build/
build-*/

# testdata/*.bin is deliberately NOT ignored: the golden batch (612 KB total,
# dumped from the PyTorch reference by tools/dump_golden.py) is the acceptance
# gate for the ctypes binding and for rt_golden. Ignoring it meant a fresh
# clone got manifest.json but no arrays, so CI could never run the gate --
# and the Python guard, which only tests for manifest.json, died on
# FileNotFoundError instead of skipping. Committed so the gate actually runs.

